</td></table>
<table border=0 cellpadding=1 cellspacing=0 width=100%><td nowrap>
<font size=3 color=#606060><strong>▽</strong> 2004/03/28 (日) 23:34:37 <strong>▽</strong> <a href="mailto:yosioka-eisaku@mvh.biglobe.ne.jp">よしおか</a> </font></td>
<td nowrap align=right><font size=3>　<a href="bbs.cgi?res=200403280233437&log=relay_novel">返信</a>　削除<input type=checkbox name="target" value="200403280233437"></font>
